ON LOCATION IDENTIFICATION
Pursuant to the Law on Government Organization No. 63/2025/QH15;

Pursuant to the Law on Local Government Organization No. 72/2025/QH15;

Pursuant to the Law on Digital Data No. 60/2024/QH15;
Pursuant to the Law on Land No. 31/2024/QH15;

Pursuant to the Law on Topographic and Cartographic No. 27/2018/QH14;
Pursuant to the Law on Personal Data Protection No. 91/2025/QH15;

Pursuant to the Law on Promulgation of Legislative Documents No. 64/2025/QH15 amended by the Law No.
87/2025/QH15;

At the request of the Minister of Public Security;
The Government promulgates the Decree on location identification.

Chapter I

GENERAL REGULATIONS

Article 1. Scope and regulated entities

1. This Decree promulgates the identification of locations within the territory of the Socialist Republic of Vietnam (excluding those under the List of state secrets); the development, management, connection, sharing, and use of the Location Identification Database; and rights, obligations, and responsibilities of relevant authorities, organizations, and individuals.
2. This Decree applies to the following entities:

a) Authorities and organizations collecting, preparing, and updating data on location identification; and management and operation of the Location Identification Database;

b) Authorities, organizations, and individuals that are lawful owners and managers of locations;
c) Authorities, organizations, and individuals connecting, sharing, and using data on location identification for state management, socio-economic development, and other activities as prescribed by laws;

d) Relevant authorities, organizations, and individuals.

Article 2. Definitions

1. Location identification is the activity of collecting and creating data, and issuing an identification code for a location in order to distinguish it from other locations.

