source:
1. The IT infrastructure of the housing and real estate market information system shall comply with regulations of the Vietnam Digital Government Architecture Framework.
2. The IT infrastructure of the housing and real estate market information system includes the following main groups of device:

a) Central processing devices;

b) Data storage, backup and recovery devices;

c) Network, transmission, routing and load balancing devices;

d) Security equipment; cybersecurity devices; encryption and authentication devices;
dd) Environmental, power and technical support devices;

e) Terminals and specialized data communication devices;
g) Workstations and relevant devices.

Article 6. Software system

1. The software system of the housing and real estate market information system shall comply with national standards and technical regulations on IT in state authorities; ensure the capability to integrate and share data with relevant information systems including:
a) Compatibility with IT infrastructure;

b) Solutions for data access and distribution services;

c) Solutions for data sharing and integration;

d) Nationwide deployment;
dd) Support for different user groups in managing, operating, updating and using information and data;

e) Diversified usage forms and user experience on mobile applications;
g) Receipt of feedback and report on data errors from users.

2. The software system of the housing and real estate market information system includes the following main application groups:

a) Database management and update group;

