3. The amounts of support for training, job conversion and job search as prescribed in Article 109 of the Land Law is prescribed by the provincial People’s Committee based on the actual circumstances in the province. However, this support amount shall not exceed 5 times the price of the same type of agricultural land as listed in the local land price schedule for the entire area of expropriated agricultural land, and must be also consistent with the provincial agricultural land allocation limit as prescribed in
