Chapter IV

HOUSING DEVELOPMENT

Section 1. GENERAL PROVISIONS

Article 30. Form of housing development

1. Housing development in housing investment and development projects including:
a) Investment and construction projects for 1 single-family house or 1 housing complex;

b) Investment projects for 1 mixed-use house or 1 mixed-use housing complex;
c) Investment projects for housing complex to synchronize housing construction with construction of technical infrastructures, social infrastructures, and other structures serving residential purposes;

d) Investment projects for infrastructures of housing complex for transferring land use right to individuals for house construction;

dd) Investment and construction projects of urban areas with houses;
e) Multi-purpose land use projects reserving project land for house construction.

2. Individuals shall engage in housing development in accordance with Section 5 of this Chapter.

Article 31. Type of houses developed in housing investment projects and standard housing area

1. Housing types developed under housing investment projects include:
a) Development of commercial housing;

b) Development of social housing, worker housing in industrial parks, houses for people’s armed forces;

c) Development of official housing;
d) Development of relocation housing;

dd) Renovation and reconstruction of apartment buildings;
e) Development of mixed-use houses under this Clause in accordance with this Law.

