Điều 4. Kiến thức chuyên môn

source:
Professional knowledge of real estate brokerage has a total duration of 24 study periods, including the following topics:

1. Topic 1: General overview of the real estate brokerage services, including the following main contents:

a) Introduction to real estate brokerage services;

b) The role of real estate brokerage in the real estate market;

c) Principles of real estate brokerage activities;

d) Conditions for real estate brokerage service business and professional requirements for real estate brokers;

dd) Factors affecting the development of real estate brokerage profession;
e) Experience of other countries in real estate brokerage services;

g) Professional ethics of real estate brokers.

2. Topic 2: Real estate brokerage process and skills, including some main contents as follows:
a) Collecting information on real estate supply and demand;

b) Identifying subjects and parties involved in real estate brokerage transactions;

c) Preparing brokerage transaction documents;

d) Real estate mortgage documents;

dd) Time limit and steps for implementing brokerage transactions;
e) Real estate marketing;

g) Communication and negotiation skills in real estate transactions;

h) Real estate offering, listing and advertising skills;
i) Organizing and managing real estate brokerage organizations;

k) Contract drafting skills;

l) Legal risk management skills in real estate transactions;

m) Applying information technology and social networks in real estate trading.

