Article 6. Fundamental knowledge

The total duration of study periods, topics, and main content of each topic shall be as prescribed in Article 3 of this Circular.

Article 7. Professional knowledge

Professional knowledge of operation of real estate trading floor has a total duration of 24 study periods, including the following topics:
1. Topic 1: Operation of the real estate trading floors, including the following main contents:

a) Introduction to real estate trading floors;
b) The role of real estate trading floors in the real estate market;

c) Principles of organization and operation of real estate trading floors;

d) Conditions for establishment and operation of real estate trading floors;

dd) Regulations on operation of real estate trading floors;
e) Conditions for managers and operators of real estate trading floors;

g) Confirmation of transactions through real estate trading floors;
h) Information on real estate and real estate trading through trading floors;

i) Organizing services at real estate trading floors.

2. Topic 2: Real estate brokerage process and skills, including some main contents as follows:
a) Collecting information on real estate supply and demand;

b) Identifying subjects and parties involved in real estate brokerage transactions;
c) Preparing brokerage transaction documents;

