b) the former holder of the repossessed land was provided with in-situ resettlement and agrees to receive the compensation for temporary residence costs.

c) the former holder of the repossessed land received land through an allocation or on-site handover of land for self-build resettlement housing by a competent authority ;
d) a competent regulatory agency handed over a resettlement house to the former holder of the repossessed land;

