3. Amendments to Article 21:
“Article 21. Procedures for establishing commercial mediation centers

1. Any Vietnamese citizen who meets the commercial mediator criteria prescribed in Clause 1 Article 7 of this Decree and wishes to establish a commercial mediation center shall submit an application for the establishment by post or in person to the Justice Department of the province of centrally affiliated city where the center is headquartered or online on the National Public Service Portal. The application includes 1 set of the following documents:

a) Written request for establishment of the commercial mediation center following the form promulgated by the Ministry of Justice of Vietnam enclosed with a list of founders;
b) Copies enclosed with the original copy for comparison, electronic copies, electronic copies from the original copy, certified electronic copies, or certified copies of documents proving that the founders meet the commercial mediator criteria prescribed in Clause 1 Article 7 of this Decree;

