1. Registration of security interests refers to the recording in a security interest register or entry into a database on security interests by a security interest registry of the use of assets by the grantor to secure the secured party’s performance of an obligation;
2. Register refers to a cadastral register or a register of mortgage of off-the-plan property on land in case of security interest in land use rights or property on land, Vietnam aircraft register in case of security interest in aircrafts, Vietnam sea-going ship register in case of security interest in sea-going ship or another register as per the law;

