Article 8. Request for Mutual Judicial Assistance

1. A request for mutual judicial assistance shall be in writing and contain the following information:

i) Date and place of issuance of the request for mutual judicial assistance;

ii) Name, address, and contact information of the Requesting Authority, including phone, fax, and email (if any);
iii) Name, address, and contact information of the Requested Authority (if any);

iv) Full name, gender, citizenship, occupation, place of birth, and address of the related persons, or the full name and address of their representatives (if any); and the name and address of any relevant agencies or organizations;

v) A description of the case, the requested matters, and other relevant information relating to the request;
