2. In addition to the contents specified in Article 8 of this Agreement, the applicant requesting recognition and enforcement of a court judgment or decision must provide the following documents:
i) A certified true copy of the court judgment or decision;

ii) If the judgment or decision does not specify its enforceability, a legally certified document confirming that the judgment or decision is legally effective;
iii) Proof of service of the judgment or decision, or other documents equivalent to proof of service;

iv) In cases where the judgment or decision was issued in the absence of the parties involved, a certified copy of the summons served to the absent party, if the judgment or decision does not clearly state that the absent party was duly summoned;
