Article 6. Procedures for issuance of permits

1. The applicants shall submit 01 set of dossier including:

a) An application for transportation of corpse, remains or ash into Vietnam using Form No. 01/NG-LS attached to this Circular;

b) Papers proving that the applicants are under the cases prescribed in Article 5 of this Circular:
