Chapter II

TRAVEL DOCUMENTS

Article 6. Travel documents

1. Travel documents consist of:
a) Diplomatic passport;

b) Official passport;

c) Ordinary passport;
d) Laissez-passer.

dd)[2] Other documents according to international treaties to which the Socialist Republic of Vietnam is a signatory.

2. Passport with or without electronic chip shall be issued to Vietnamese citizens of 14 years of age or older.
Passport without electronic chip shall be issued to Vietnamese citizens under 14 years of age or issued via simplified procedures.

3. [3] Information on travel documents includes:
