b) Decide the assignment of Judges to accept the civil cases, Judges to resolve civil cases, People’s Jurors to participate in trial panels to hear civil lawsuits; and decide the assignment of ombudspersons, Court clerks to conduct procedures for civil cases, ensuring the principle prescribed in clause 2 Article 16 of this Code;

c) Decide the replacement of Judges, People’s Jurors, Ombudspersons and/or Court clerks before the opening of Court sessions;
d) Decide the replacement of expert-witnesses and/or interpreters before the opening of Court sessions;

