e) Settle complaints and/or denunciations according to regulations of this Code;

g) File appeals according to the cassation or reopening procedures against legally-effective Court judgments or decisions according to regulations of this Code or request the competent Chief Justice to consider the appeal according to the cassation or reopening procedures against legally- effective Court judgments or decisions;

h) Request a competent agency to consider amending or repealing a legislative document if such document is discovered denoting against constitutions, laws, resolutions of National Assembly, ordinances, resolutions of the Standing committee of the National Assembly, legislative documents of superior regulatory agencies as prescribed in this Code;
i) Resolve the acts obstructing the civil procedures as prescribed in law;

