within 03 working days from the date on which the applications are received, the Courts shall record to the registers defense counsels of the involved parties’ legitimate rights and interests and shall certify applications for defense counsels of the involved parties. In case of refusal, the Courts shall notify the applicants in writing and provide the explanation.

