Article 17.

LISTS OF NARCOTICS AND PRECURSORS
Pursuant to Law on Government Organization No. 63/2025/QH15;

Pursuant to Law on Prevention and Control of Narcotic Substances No. 73/2021/QH14;

Pursuant to Criminal Code No. 100/2015/QH13 amended by Law No. 12/2017/QH14 and Law No.
86/2025/QH15;

Pursuant to Law on Chemicals No. 69/2025/QH15;

Pursuant to Law on Pharmacy No. 105/2016/QH13 amended by Law No. 44/2024/QH15;
At the request of the Minister of Public Security;

The Government of Vietnam hereby promulgates a Decree on Lists of narcotics and precursors.

Article 1. Lists of narcotics and precursors

The Appendix of lists of narcotics and precursors is issued together with this Decree:

List I: Narcotics strictly forbidden from medicine or social life, the use of which for research, testing, examination or for national defense and security purposes is subject to permission by competent authorities.
IA. Addictive substances and salts, isomers, esters, ethers, and the salts of isomers, esters and ethers whenever the existence of such substances is possible (unless the esters or ethers of the substances are included in another list);

IB. Psychotropic substances and salts, isomers and the salts of isomers whenever the existence of such substances is possible.
List II: Restricted narcotics for use in research, testing, examination or for national defense and security purposes or in the field of medicine as regulated by competent authorities.

IIA. Addictive substances and salts, isomers, esters, ethers, and the salts of isomers, esters and ethers whenever the existence of such substances is possible (unless the esters or ethers of the substances are included in another list);

IIB. Psychotropic substances and salts, isomers and the salts of isomers whenever the existence of such substances is possible.
List III: Narcotics used in research, testing, examination or for national defense and security purposes or in the field of medicine and veterinary medicine as regulated by competent authorities.

