Chapter IV

RECEIPT AND ASSISTANCE FOR COMMUNITY REINTEGRATION

Article 12. Responsibilities of persons directly providing assistance and agencies, organizations,

individuals, and families participating in assisting persons having completely served prison sentences with community reintegration
1. A person directly providing assistance to a person having completely served a prison sentence shall

