Documents referred to under this Clause shall be original copies, certified true copies, or electronic copies.

3. Procedures for reissuance, amendment, supplement of operating license

a) Organizations and individuals applying for human trafficking victim support license shall submit application under Clause 1 of this Article to Departments of Health of administrative divisions where they are based;
b) Organizations and individuals applying for amendment, supplement of certificate, depending on reasons for amendment and supplement, shall send corresponding application under Clause 2 of this Article to Departments of Health of administrative divisions where facilities are located;

