Article 4. Transition clauses

1. From July 01, 2025, this Law shall be applied as follows:
a) Regulations of Article 1 of this Law shall be applied to bringing charges, investigation, prosecution, trial and judgment execution of people who commit criminal acts from 00:00 (12 a.m.) of July 01, 2025;

b) Regulations that are more advantageous to people who commit the crimes prescribed in Articles 40, 63, 109, 110, 114, 194, 248, 250, 251, 353, 354 and 421 of the Criminal Code No. 100/2015/QH13, which is amended by Law No. 12/2017/QH14 and Law No. 59/2024/QH15 (hereinafter referred to as “the Criminal Code”) that are amended by Clauses 1, 4, 5, 6, 7, 10, 18, 22, 23 and 29 Article 1 of this Law and other regulations that are advantageous to the offenders may be applied to crimes that are committed before 00:00 (12 a.m.) of July 01, 2025 and discovered afterwards or undergoing investigation, prosecution or trial;

