Chapter III

IMPLEMENTATION

Article 8. Effect

This Circular comes into force from July 1, 2026 and replaces Circular No. 184/2019/TT-BQP dated December 4, 2019 of the Minister of National Defense on prohibited items and the confiscation and disposal of items prohibited from bringing in places of imprisonment execution.

Article 9. Responsibility for Implementation

1. The General Staff, the General Political Department, the heads of agencies and units affiliated to the Ministry of National Defense and relevant agencies, units, organizations and individuals are responsible for implementing this Circular.
