3. [31] Remedial measures:
a) Enforced display of the quantity of pre-packed goods, forcing displayed of the measuring unit, enforced specification of the quantitative mark of prepackaged goods produced as prescribed before continuing to put into circulation for violations specified in Point a Clause 1 of this Article;

