Article 4. List of professional technical equipment and devices subject to inspection and calibration under

the management of the Ministry of Construction
1. The inspection and calibration of professional technical equipment and devices before use shall be carried out in accordance with laws on measurement.

2. The following professional technical equipment and devices shall satisfy inspection requirements before being used:
a) Length-measuring equipment;

b) Vehicle load inspection scales;

c) Speed guns with image recording;
d) Breath alcohol concentration measuring equipment;

dd) Satellite navigation equipment;
e) Sound level meters;

