4. Sanctioning administrative violation for one of the acts of violation specified in Clause 3 of this Article applies for each type of vehicle as follows:

a) A fine of between VND 200,000 and 300,000 shall be imposed on the non-motorized vehicles with gross tonnage from 05 to 15 tons or loading from over 12 to 50 persons; motorized vehicles with total capacity of main engine from over 05 to 15HP or loading from over 05 to 12 persons;

