Article 72. Authority of border Guard

The border Guard has the right to impose sanction against administrative violation for acts of violation of regulation on traffic buildings; vehicles, seaman, controller of inland waterway transportation vehicle in border area within the responsibility of border Guard, except for scope of responsibility of the inland waterway Port Authority. The authority is as follows:

