a) Use force to obstruct a person from creating or critiquing literary or artistic works, performing, or participating in other cultural activities or physical exercise and sports activities on the grounds of gender prejudice;
b) Preventing another person from creating or critiquing literary or artistic works, performing, or participating in other cultural activities or physical exercise and sports activities on the grounds of gender prejudice;

3. A fine ranging from VND 10.000.000 to VND 15.000.000 shall be imposed on any person committing any of the following acts:
a) Creating, circulating, publishing or permitting the publication of works or cultural products in any genre or form that promote or disseminate gender discrimination or gender prejudice;

b) Disseminating discriminatory ideas, obsolete customs or practices that discriminate on the basis of gender in any form.
4. Additional penalties:

a) Suspension of the operation license for a period of from 03 months to 06 months for the act of circulating, publishing or permitting the publication of works or cultural products specified in Point a Clause 3 of this Article;

b) Confiscation of exhibits and vehicles used for commission of administrative violations, for the acts specified in point a Clause 2 of this Article.
5. Remedial measures:

a) Compulsory public apology to the infringed person for the act specified in Clause 1 of this Article (unless the infringed person has submitted a written request waiving such apology);

b) Compulsory restoration of the lawful rights and interests of the infringed person for the acts specified in Points a and b Clause 2 of this Article;
c) Compulsory removal, revision, replacement or correction of works and cultural products containing gender prejudice or promoting or disseminating gender discrimination; where such works or cultural products are not removed, revised, replaced or corrected, compulsory destruction thereof for the act specified in Point a Clause 3 of this Article;

