Article 7. Amendments to Article 15:

“Article 15. Power to impose administrative penalties by Chairpersons of the People's Committees at all levels

1. The Chairperson of the People's Committee of a commune, ward or special zone (hereinafter referred to as “a commune”) shall have the power to:
a) Issue warnings;

b) Impose a fine of up to VND 15.000.000;
c) Deprive the right to use the operation license for a definite term;

d) Confiscate exhibits and/or vehicles used for commission of administrative violations;
dd) Enforce the remedial measures specified in clause 3 Article 4 of this Decree.

2. The Chairperson of the People’s Committee of a province or city (hereinafter referred to as “a province”) shall have the power to:
a) Issue warnings;

b) Impose a fine of up to VND 30.000.000;
c) Deprive the right to use the operation license for a definite term;

d) Confiscate exhibits and/or vehicles used for commission of administrative violations;
dd) Enforce the remedial measures specified in clause 3 Article 4 of this Decree.”.

