Article 8. Hire of professional technical equipment and devices

1. The hire, management and use of professional technical equipment and devices serving the detection of administrative violations shall comply with laws on management and use of public property, laws on bidding, and relevant laws.

2. Requirements for hire of professional technical equipment and devices:

a) Professional technical equipment and devices included in the list prescribed in clause 1, Article 6 of this Decree, and in accordance with standards, norms and purpose of use as prescribed by laws;

b) New professional technical equipment and devices that have equivalent functions with those prescribed in clause 1, Article 6 of this Decree, and are able to accurately detect violations;

c) Compliance with laws on inspection, calibration and testing; technical standards, technical regulations and quality of goods and products.
3. The management and use of hired professional technical equipment and devices shall comply with laws on management and use prescribed in this Decree and relevant laws.

Article 9. Equipping professional technical equipment and devices

1. Principles for equipping professional technical equipment and devices:

a) Comply with standards, norms and regimes for using professional technical equipment and devices at equipped authorities and units; ensure economy, efficiency, and avoid waste;

b) Comply with functions, tasks, powers and authority for imposing administrative penalties as prescribed in clause 2 of this Article; requirements for combating administrative violations;

c) Comply with equipping procedures in accordance with laws on management and use of public property and relevant laws.
