2. A fine of between VND 10,000,000 and VND 15,000,000 for one of the following acts:

a/ Having no licenses for transport of hazardous substances;
b/ Transporting hazardous substances at variance with the provisions of the licenses.

3. A fine of between VND 15,000,000 and VND 20,000,000 for one of the following acts:
a/ Transporting hazardous cargoes together with passengers;

b/ Hazardous substances not properly packed, marked or labeled and put in the state appropriate for transportation in order to minimize danger to the marine environment;
