b/ Confiscating means, forcing the destruction of hazardous substances used for commission of administrative violations specified at Point a, Clause 2 of this Article.

Article 21.- Sanctioning of violations in the transport of waste matters by sea

1. A fine of between VND 5,000,000 and VND 10,000,000 for one of the following acts:

a/ Transporting waste matters and environmental pollutants at variance with the regulations on environmental protection;

