3a. Principles for determining illicit gains obtained from administrative violations:

The amount of illicit gains shall be determined by the person having the power to impose administrative penalties and specified in the penalty imposition decision or the decision to impose the remedial measure.

Illicit gains shall be determined as follows: In respect of a terminated administrative violation, illicit gains shall be calculated from the time the organization or individual commenced the administrative violation until the time the violation ended. In respect of an ongoing administrative violation, illicit gains shall be calculated from the time the organization or individual commenced the administrative violation until the time the violation is detected by a competent authority or person.

