3. When applying such measures, the competent persons shall have to strictly abide by the provisions of Articles 39, 41, 42, 43 and 44 of the Ordinance on Handling of Administrative Violations.

4. In cases where the persons stipulated in Clause 1 of this Article are absent or unable to fulfill their tasks, their deputies shall have the competence to make decision.

