ON ADMINISTRATIVE PENALTIES IN ROAD OPERATIONS
Pursuant to the Law on Government Organization No. 63/2025/QH15;

Pursuant to the Law on Local Government Organization No. 72/2025/QH15;

Pursuant to the Law on Penalties for Administrative Violations No. 15/2012/QH13 amended by Law No. 54/2014/QH13, Law No. 18/2017/QH14, Law No. 67/2020/QH14, Law No.
09/2022/QH15, Law No. 11/2022/QH15, Law No. 56/2022/QH15, and Law No. 88/2025/QH15;

Pursuant to the Law on Road No. 35/2024/QH15;

At the request of the Ministry of Construction;
The Government hereby issues a Decree on administrative penalties in road operations.

Chapter I

GENERAL REGULATIONS

Article 1. Scope

1. This Decree regulates administrative violations; ended or in-progress administrative violations; penalties, fines, remedial measures for each administrative violation; entities subject to penalties; authority for imposing penalties and fines according to each title; authority for making records of administrative violations; execution of administrative penalties and remedial measures for violations against regulations on road operations in road traffic.
2. Other Decrees on administrative penalties for corresponding violations shall apply to administrative violations against regulations on road operations and other administrative violations against regulations on state management related to road operations that are not provided for in this Decree.

Article 2. Entities subject to penalties

1. Organizations and individuals that commit violations against regulations on road operations within the territory of Socialist Republic of Vietnam.

2. Organizations prescribed in Clauses 1 and 2 of this Article include:
a) State authorities committing violations that are not related to assigned state management tasks;

target:
QUY ĐỊNH XỬ PHẠT VI PHẠM HÀNH CHÍNH TRONG HOẠT ĐỘNG ĐƯỜNG BỘ
Căn cứ Luật Tổ chức Chính phủ số 63/2025/QH15;

