b) Illegally hanging banners within the land of road affecting road traffic safety;
c) Installing or hanging signs, billboards on land of road at road sections outside of urban areas except for act of placing signs or billboards in roadway and except for violations under point a of Clause 5 of this Article;

d) Dumping trash and waste on roads outside designated places, except for violations under point a of Clause 4 of this Article.

3. A fine ranging from VND 3.000.000 to VND 5.000.000 shall be imposed on individuals, and from VND 6.000.000 to VND 10.000.000 shall be imposed on organizations for acts of illegally erecting booths, tents, gates, fences, walls, or other types of works within the land area for road infrastructure, except violations under point d of Clause 4; point a of Clause 5; points a, b, d of Clause 6 of this Article.

4. A fine ranging from VND 4.000.000 to VND 6.000.000 shall be imposed on individuals, and from VND 8.000.000 to VND 10.000.000 shall be imposed on organizations for committing one of the following violations:

a) Dumping, placing materials or wastes within the road safety corridor;

b) Digging, leveling, filling ground within land reserved for road infrastructure;

c) Attaching, hanging, installing, or placing irrelevant content on/to road signaling works, falsifying or deactivating road signs;
d) Illegally erecting tents or other works in urban areas at road tunnels, flyovers, pedestrian tunnels, under flyovers, except violations under point a of Clause 6 of this Article;

dd) Failing to provide proper drainage or obstructing, blocking drainage systems from structures belonging to road infrastructure as prescribed;

