Article 20. Rules for determination of powers to impose administrative penalties and

application of remedial measures
1. Rules for determination of powers to impose administrative penalties and application of remedial measures in road operations shall comply with Article 52 of the Law on Penalties for Administrative Violations and Article 4 of Government’s Decree No. 189/2025/ND-CP dated July 1, 2025, elaborating the Law on Penalties for Administrative Violations on the authority to impose administrative penalties.

2. Fines imposed by titles specified in Articles 17, 18, and 19 of this Decree are penalties imposed on individuals committing administrative violations; fines imposed on organizations shall be twice those of individuals.

Article 21. Authority for preparation of records of administrative violations

